### Finding 1: Scribe MCP registration matches across both repos

Current generated Claude-style `.mcp.json` and Codex `.codex/config.toml` registrations are aligned:

| Surface | `scribe_mcp` value/path | `council_mcp` value/path | Source authority | Latency risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
