| Codex MCP `scribe` server | `.codex/config.toml:119-124`: same command/env plus enabled Scribe tools | `.codex/config.toml:124-129`: same command/env plus enabled Scribe tools | `council_mcp/src/council_mcp/services/scribe_launch.py:49-77`, `:109-146`; `services/mcp_servers.py:1710-1725`, `:2631-2653` | Low for server mismatch; medium if generated config drift exists outside inspected files. |
